## pali mi

@ html.class=projects html.pair=1 gemini.col=58
=> [!~ATH | toki ilo nasa mi tan lipu Homestuck](@ath)
=> [viewpoint | ilo pi toki tawa ilo sona, kepeken nasin WIMP](@viewpoint)
=> [fontliberator | ilo li pali sin e nasin sitelen, li lanpan ala. jan li pali ala](@fontlib)
=> [xcaca | ilo pana X lon sitelen ASCII](@xcaca)
=> [ilo ni la lipu pi musi Hypnospace Outlaw li kama lipu W3 lon](@hsp)
